---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import MatcherBench from './MatcherBench.astro';
import deployed from '../assets/impedance-deployed.jpg';
import { projects } from '../data/projects';
const arrow = 'M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6';
---
<div class="matcher-exhibit" data-matcher-exhibit data-mode="machine">
  <figure class="matcher-visual" aria-label="Impedance matcher inspection" data-matcher-visual>
    <div class="matcher-model" data-matcher-model>
      <img class="matcher-render" src="/assets/matcher/overview.webp" alt="Model of the impedance matcher, with two air-variable capacitor plate stacks, stepper motors and the blue controller housing." width="1440" height="1080" loading="lazy" data-matcher-render />
      <div class="matcher-canvas" data-matcher-canvas aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="matcher-callouts" data-matcher-callouts hidden>
        <svg class="matcher-leaders" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path data-leader="capacitors" d="M20 27L35 42" /><path data-leader="motors" d="M80 60L65 64" /><path data-leader="control" d="M20 82L43 72" />
        </svg>
        <button type="button" data-matcher-part="capacitors" aria-pressed="true">Air capacitors<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5v14" /></svg></button>
        <button type="button" data-matcher-part="motors" aria-pressed="false">Stepper motors<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5v14" /></svg></button>
        <button type="button" data-matcher-part="control" aria-pressed="false">Controller &amp; display<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5v14" /></svg></button>
      </div>
      <div class="matcher-angle-readings" hidden data-matcher-angles><span>C1 <b data-matcher-c1>72°</b></span><span>C2 <b data-matcher-c2>108°</b></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="matcher-lab-photo" data-matcher-lab hidden>
      <a class="project-card matcher-real-build" href="project-impedance.html">
        <Picture src={deployed} formats={['avif','webp']} widths={[480,800,1200]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 90vw, 54vw" alt="The deployed impedance matcher in CMU Hacker Fab, showing VSWR 1.235 on its OLED display." loading="lazy" />
        <span>Explore the real build <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={arrow} /></svg></span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="matcher-visual-caption" data-matcher-caption>Two capacitors. One control loop.</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <div class="journey-panel matcher-panel">
    <h3 id="story-matcher-heading">Automated <br />impedance matcher</h3>
    <div class="matcher-modes" data-matcher-modes hidden role="group" aria-label="Explore the impedance matcher">
      <button type="button" data-matcher-mode="machine" aria-pressed="true">Machine</button>
      <button type="button" data-matcher-mode="inside" aria-pressed="false">Inside</button>
      <button type="button" data-matcher-mode="tune" aria-pressed="false">Tune</button>
      <button type="button" data-matcher-mode="lab" aria-pressed="false">In the lab</button>
    </div>
    <div data-matcher-panel="machine">
      <p class="journey-summary">Plasma conditions change. The match follows.<br />A closed-loop RF matcher replaces manual capacitor tuning with repeatable, automated control.</p>
      <dl class="matcher-measured"><div><dt>Deployed match</dt><dd>~1.2 <span>VSWR</span></dd></div><div><dt>Forward power</dt><dd>95 <span>W</span></dd></div><div><dt>Build cost</dt><dd>$636</dd></div></dl>
      <p class="matcher-invitation">Look inside the mechanism, or detune it and watch the controller find its way back.</p>
      <a class="workshop-link" href={projects.impedance.route}>Explore the project<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={arrow} /></svg></a>
    </div>
    <div class="matcher-inspection" data-matcher-panel="inside" hidden>
      <div data-matcher-detail="capacitors"><h4>A match, made mechanical.</h4><p>Turning the two air-variable capacitors changes the RF network. The plate overlap changes capacitance; the controller searches both axes for lower reflected power.</p><p class="matcher-detail-spec">500 V air-variable capacitors<br />T-network · ~2 µH coil</p></div>
      <div data-matcher-detail="motors" hidden><h4>Small steps. Fine control.</h4><p>Two stepper motors turn the capacitor shafts. Microstepping lets the firmware make small corrections as the chamber’s impedance drifts.</p><p class="matcher-detail-spec">0.9° NEMA 17 steppers<br />1/64 microstepping</p></div>
      <div data-matcher-detail="control" hidden><h4>Sense. Decide. Adjust.</h4><p>A Teensy 4.1 and custom control PCB read forward and reverse power, then command the motors. The OLED and encoder provide local control.</p><p class="matcher-detail-spec">Teensy 4.1 · custom two-layer PCB<br />I2C OLED · rotary encoder</p></div>
      <p class="matcher-inspect-hint">Select a component to follow its role in the loop.</p>
    </div>
    <div data-matcher-panel="tune" hidden><MatcherBench embedded /></div>
    <div class="matcher-lab-copy" data-matcher-panel="lab" hidden>
      <h4>From the bench<br />to the chamber.</h4>
      <p>Deployed at CMU Hacker Fab, the matcher held approximately 1.2 VSWR at 95–100 W through a roughly 60-minute deposition run.</p>
      <p class="matcher-lab-note">The run ended when the plasma extinguished from pump brownout or debris—not matcher drift.</p>
      <a class="workshop-link" href={projects.impedance.route+'#results'}>Read the measured results<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={arrow} /></svg></a>
    </div>
    <p class="matcher-view-status sr-only" data-matcher-live role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <noscript><p class="matcher-noscript">The deployed matcher holds ~1.2 VSWR at 95–100 W. <a href="/project-impedance.html">See the mechanism, photographs and results.</a></p></noscript>
  </div>
</div>
